### ============================================================================
### 💍 SINDHI MATRIMONY BACKEND - INTERACTIVE REST CLIENT COLLECTION
### ============================================================================
### Use this file with VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client.
### 
### Quick Start Instructions:
### 1. Ensure backend is running: npm run dev (runs on http://localhost:5000)
### 2. Hit "Health Check" below to verify connectivity.
### 3. Hit "Send OTP" or "Verify OTP / Login" with master OTP 123456.
### 4. Copy the "token" from response and paste it into @authToken below.
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@authToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.your_token_here
@profileId = 67b34a12c8e312a0f9000001
@grantId = 67b34a12c8e312a0f9000002
@photoId = 67b34a12c8e312a0f9000003

### ============================================================================
### 1. SYSTEM & HEALTH CHECK
### ============================================================================

### 1.1 Health Check (Verify API Gateway & DB status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================================================
### 2. AUTHENTICATION & REGISTRATION MODULE
### ============================================================================

### 2.1 Send OTP (Login Purpose)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "countryCode": "+91",
  "purpose": "LOGIN"
}

### 2.2 Send OTP (Register Purpose)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9829012345",
  "countryCode": "+91",
  "purpose": "REGISTER"
}

### 2.3 Verify OTP & Login (Returns JWT Token & Active Profile Context)
### Note: In development mode (NODE_ENV=development), OTP "123456" is always accepted!
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "otp": "123456",
  "countryCode": "+91",
  "clientPlatform": "WEB"
}

### 2.4 Quick Registration (New User + Profile + Partner Preference Creation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9829012345",
  "otp": "123456",
  "name": "Rohan Advani",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "profileFor": "MYSELF",
  "countryCode": "+91",
  "clientPlatform": "WEB",
  "subcaste": "Bhaiband",
  "dob": "1997-06-15",
  "maritalStatus": "NEVER_MARRIED",
  "height": 178,
  "education": "B.Tech Computer Science",
  "profession": "Software Engineer",
  "annualIncome": 1800000,
  "city": "Jaipur",
  "state": "Rajasthan",
  "nativePlace": "Ajmer"
}

### 2.5 Resend OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "countryCode": "+91",
  "purpose": "LOGIN"
}

### 2.6 Instant Phone Number Check (For typing check on register screen)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/check-phone
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "countryCode": "+91"
}

### 2.7 Logout (Blacklists JWT Token in Redis)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ============================================================================
### 3. MULTI-PROFILE & FAMILY DELEGATION ARCHITECTURE
### ============================================================================

### 3.1 List All Candidate Profiles Managed by this Account
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/my-profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3.2 Create Secondary Profile (e.g. Sibling or Child under same parent phone)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Simran Advani",
  "profileFor": "DAUGHTER",
  "gender": "FEMALE",
  "subcaste": "Bhaiband",
  "dob": "1999-09-20",
  "maritalStatus": "NEVER_MARRIED",
  "height": 165,
  "education": "MBA Finance",
  "profession": "Financial Analyst",
  "annualIncome": 1200000,
  "city": "Mumbai",
  "state": "Maharashtra"
}

### 3.3 Switch Active Profile Context (Returns fresh JWT with updated profileId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/switch-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetProfileId": "{{profileId}}"
}

### 3.4 Update Profile Status (ACTIVE / HIDDEN / DEACTIVATED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/users/profiles/{{profileId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "HIDDEN"
}

### 3.5 Grant Family Delegation Access (Allow relative/parent to co-manage profile)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/users/profiles/{{profileId}}/grants
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "granteePhone": "9829099999",
  "accessRole": "CO_MANAGER",
  "relationshipToCandidate": "PARENT"
}

### 3.6 List Active Profile Delegation Grants
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/users/profiles/{{profileId}}/grants
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3.7 Revoke Family Delegation Grant
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/auth/users/profiles/{{profileId}}/grants/{{grantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3.8 Transfer Profile Ownership to Candidate's Own Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/users/profiles/{{profileId}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "candidatePhone": "9829099999",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### ============================================================================
### 4. CANDIDATE PROFILE MANAGEMENT MODULE
### ============================================================================

### 4.1 Get My Complete Candidate Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 4.2 Update Basic & Cultural Details (Subcaste, Gotra, Location, Height)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/profile/basic
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maritalStatus": "NEVER_MARRIED",
  "height": 178,
  "subcaste": "Bhaiband",
  "gotra": "Advani",
  "motherGotra": "Chhabria",
  "aboutMe": "Passionate software engineer from Jaipur, fond of Sindhi cuisine and travel.",
  "location": {
    "city": "Jaipur",
    "state": "Rajasthan",
    "country": "India",
    "nativePlace": "Ajmer"
  }
}

### 4.3 Update Education & Career Details
PUT {{baseUrl}}/profile/education-career
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "education": {
    "degree": "B.Tech",
    "field": "Computer Science",
    "college": "MNIT Jaipur"
  },
  "profession": {
    "occupation": "Software Engineer",
    "companyName": "Tech Enterprises",
    "annualIncome": 1800000,
    "currency": "INR"
  }
}

### 4.4 Update Family Background Details
PUT {{baseUrl}}/profile/family
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "family": {
    "fatherName": "Rajesh Advani",
    "fatherOccupation": "Business (Textiles)",
    "motherName": "Kavita Advani",
    "motherOccupation": "Homemaker",
    "brothersCount": 1,
    "sistersCount": 0,
    "familyType": "NUCLEAR",
    "familyValues": "MODERATE"
  }
}

### 4.5 Update Astro & Kundli Horoscope Details
PUT {{baseUrl}}/profile/horoscope
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "manglik": "NON_MANGLIK",
  "horoscope": {
    "nakshatra": "Rohini",
    "rashi": "Vrishabha",
    "charan": 2,
    "birthTime": "10:30 AM",
    "birthPlace": "Ajmer"
  }
}

### 4.6 Update Partner Preferences
PUT {{baseUrl}}/profile/partner-preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ageMin": 22,
  "ageMax": 28,
  "heightMin": 155,
  "heightMax": 175,
  "maritalStatus": [
    "NEVER_MARRIED"
  ],
  "subcastes": [
    "Bhaiband",
    "Amil",
    "Sindhi"
  ],
  "manglikPreference": [
    "NON_MANGLIK",
    "DON_T_KNOW"
  ],
  "preferredCities": [
    "Jaipur",
    "Mumbai",
    "Pune",
    "Ahmedabad"
  ],
  "minAnnualIncome": 500000
}

### 4.7 Save Onboarding Wizard Step (Step 1 to 7)
POST {{baseUrl}}/profile/onboarding/step
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "step": 2,
  "data": {
    "subcaste": "Bhaiband",
    "gotra": "Advani",
    "motherGotra": "Chhabria"
  }
}

### 4.8 Upload Profile Photo
POST {{baseUrl}}/profile/photos
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?w=600",
  "isMain": true
}

### 4.9 Delete Profile Photo
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/profile/photos/{{photoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================================================
### 5. DEV PERFORMANCE TRACKER & METRICS (DEV MODE ONLY)
### ============================================================================

### 5.1 Fetch API Performance Metrics JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/dev/metrics
Content-Type: application/json

### 5.2 Reset Performance Metrics
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/dev/metrics
Content-Type: application/json
